{"sha": "4b04abe85500cea427baeb3116b0982d3dd2ec02e23dae1821cbdd1b993ccc83", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:spin-two-level} 章 --- 自旋与两能级系统}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:1}", "(a) 直接相乘。(b) $[\\hat S_x, \\hat S_y] =", "(\\hbar/2)^2\\,2\\iu\\sigma_z = \\iu\\hbar\\hat S_z$。(c) $\\hat S^2 =", "(\\hbar/2)^2 \\times 3\\,\\mathbb 1 = \\tfrac34\\hbar^2$，确为", "$\\tfrac12\\cdot\\tfrac32\\hbar^2$。(d) $\\{\\mathbb 1, \\sigma_x,", "\\sigma_y, \\sigma_z\\}$ 张成", "厄米 $2\\times2$ 矩阵构成的四维实空间（$a + \\vect b\\cdot\\vect\\sigma$，其中 $a,", "\\vect b$ 均为实数）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:2}", "(a) $\\ket{\\pm x} = (\\ket\\uparrow \\pm \\ket\\downarrow)/\\sqrt2$；", "$\\ket{\\pm y} = (\\ket\\uparrow \\pm \\iu\\ket\\downarrow)/\\sqrt2$。(b)", "各占一半。(c) 仍各占一半：$|\\braket{\\pm y}{+x}|^2 =", "|1 \\mp \\iu|^2/4 = \\tfrac12$。(d) $\\ket{+x}$：赤道上 $\\varphi =", "0$；沿 $z$ 或 $y$ 方向测量时，投影到相距 $90^\\circ$ 的极点上", "--- 总是 $\\cos^2(45^\\circ) = \\tfrac12$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:3}", "(a) $\\cos^2(\\theta/2)$。(b) $\\cos^2(\\theta/2) \\times", "\\cos^2(\\theta/2) = \\cos^4(\\theta/2)$。(c) $\\theta = 90^\\circ$：", "$(\\tfrac12)^2 = \\tfrac14$，即起偏器链的结果。(d)", "显然 $\\theta = 0$；真正的启示在于\\emph{温和}的", "中间测量代价最小 --- 这正是", "\\cref{exo:b3:quantum-formalism:5}的小步极限，许多小转动使态通过时", "损耗趋于零。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:4}", "(a) $2\\mu_{\\text{B}}B = \\qty{116}{\\micro eV}$：$\\nu =", "\\qty{28}{GHz}$。(b) $2 \\times 2.79\\,\\mu_{\\text{N}}B =", "\\qty{0.18}{\\micro eV}$：$\\nu = \\qty{42.6}{MHz}$。(c)", "与 $k_{\\text{B}}T = \\qty{25.9}{meV}$ 相比，电子极化", "度为 $\\sim\\num{2e-3}$，质子 $\\sim\\num{3e-6}$ --- 热", "平衡下的自旋系综几乎完全无序。(d) ESR：微波；", "NMR：射频 --- 两者相距三个数量级，同属一种物理。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:5}", "(a) $\\dd\\langle\\hat S_x\\rangle/\\dd t = -\\gamma B_0\\langle\\hat", "S_y\\rangle$，$\\dd\\langle\\hat S_y\\rangle/\\dd t = \\gamma", "B_0\\langle\\hat S_x\\rangle$，$\\dd\\langle\\hat S_z\\rangle/\\dd t = 0$。", "(b) $\\langle\\hat S_x\\rangle = \\tfrac\\hbar2\\cos\\omega_0t$，", "$\\langle\\hat S_y\\rangle = \\tfrac\\hbar2\\sin\\omega_0t$（符号", "由 $\\gamma$ 的符号决定）。(c) 两者均由(b)直接看出。(d) 态是", "两个能量本征态的\\emph{叠加}；其相对", "相位以 $\\omega_0$ 推进，而这一旋转相位\\emph{正是}", "进动 --- 定态能级与转矢是", "同一两能级演化的两种读法。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:6}", "(a) 代入并利用半角公式。(b)", "$\\cos\\tfrac\\theta2\\cos\\tfrac{\\pi-\\theta}2 +", "\\eu^{\\iu\\pi}\\sin\\tfrac\\theta2\\sin\\tfrac{\\pi-\\theta}2 =", "\\cos\\tfrac\\theta2\\sin\\tfrac\\theta2 -", "\\sin\\tfrac\\theta2\\cos\\tfrac\\theta2 = 0$。(c) 赤道上取", "$\\varphi = 0, \\pi$（$\\sigma_x$）与 $\\varphi = \\pm\\pi/2$", "（$\\sigma_y$）处。(d) 绕任一赤道轴的 $180^\\circ$ 转动", "--- 磁共振中的 $\\pi$ 脉冲即量子比特的 NOT 门。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:7}", "(a) 在旋转参考系中驱动场静止，而参考系的", "旋转从有效静磁场中减去 $\\omega/\\gamma$", "（与旋转参考系中惯性力的处理方式相同）。(b) 只剩", "$B_1$：布洛赫矢量绕（固定的）", "横向 $B_1$ 轴以 $\\Omega_1 = |\\gamma|B_1$ 进动 --- 稳定", "翻转。(c) $t_\\pi = \\pi/\\gamma B_1 = 1/(2 \\times 42.58\\,\\text{", "MHz/T} \\times 10\\,\\unit{\\micro T}) = \\qty{1.2}{ms}$。(d) 一条快速", "收紧锥面的螺旋：绕 $z$ 轴的进动频率为 \\qty{128}{MHz}，", "同时以 \\qty{426}{Hz} 缓慢向下章动 --- 一条千圈的", "螺线，从一极到另一极。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:8}", "(a) $\\nu = \\Delta E/h = \\num{5.9e-6}/\\num{4.14e-15} =", "\\qty{1.42e9}{Hz}$；$\\lambda = c/\\nu = \\qty{21.1}{cm}$。(b) $\\Delta", "\\nu \\sim 1/2\\pi\\tau \\sim \\qty{e-15}{Hz}$：完全可忽略 ---", "每个观测到的线宽都源于运动。(c) $\\Delta\\nu =", "\\nu\\,(2v/c) = 1420\\,\\text{MHz} \\times \\num{1.5e-3} \\approx", "\\qty{2}{MHz}$：旋转圆盘的双峰轮廓。(d)", "凡氢呈原子态（温暖、弥散）之处，21 cm 线都可显示；CO", "则显示氢已结合为不可见的 H$_2$（寒冷、", "致密）：二者合用，可盘点一个星系的整个星际", "介质。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:9}", "(a) 两种构型，经隧穿耦合：低能时态空间为", "二维的 --- 氨\\emph{就是}一个", "伪装的自旋 $\\tfrac12$ 体系。(b) $\\nu = \\Delta E/h = \\qty{24}{GHz}$，$\\lambda =", "\\qty{1.25}{cm}$。(c) 束流到达时，必须使\\emph{上}", "能级布居过多（由静电偏转选出） ---", "即粒子数反转，热平衡下不可获得，因为玻尔兹曼", "总是偏爱低能级。(d) 受激放大靠", "粒子数反转 --- 激光器的工作原理，", "首先在微波频率上得到演示。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:spin-two-level:10}", "(a) $\\mu_{\\text{B}} \\times \\qty{10}{T} = \\qty{0.58}{meV}$，", "与 $\\alpha^2E_{\\text{I}} \\approx \\qty{0.7}{meV}$ 量级相当，见", "\\cref{exo:b3:hydrogen-atom:11}：精细结构\\emph{正是}自旋", "与运动磁场相遇。(b) $\\Delta E = hc\\,\\Delta\\lambda/", "\\lambda^2 = \\qty{2.1}{meV}$：内部场 $\\Delta E/2\\mu_{", "\\text{B}} \\approx \\qty{18}{T}$。(c) 内场随", "$Z^4$ 增长（核电荷的三次方在场中，再一次在轨道", "半径中）：重原子的精细结构用袖珍", "分光镜直接看到。(d) $j = \\tfrac32$：四个态；$j = \\tfrac12$：两个", "--- 共六个，恰为 $2 \\times (2l + 1)$，当 $l = 1$ 时。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}